# Tailscale auth key for the review node.
#   cp ts.env.example ts.env && chmod 600 ts.env
#
# THIS MUST BE A KEY FROM A SEPARATE TAILSCALE ACCOUNT, not the tailnet that
# carries openbb-docker, the NAS or the Spark. The isolation this stack claims
# is structural -- a node with no peers cannot reach a service -- and it stops
# being structural the moment the node joins a tailnet that has peers.
TS_AUTHKEY=
